sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: To construct a rectilinear angle equal to a given rectilinear angle on a given straight line and at a point on it.
----
proof:

Let the angle {DCE} be the given rectilinear angle, {AB} the given straight line, and {A} the point on it.

